          "Property cases": [
            "These cases are since 2011 handled by Land and environment courts at the District courts in Nacka, Umeå, Vänersborg, Växjö and Östersund. Previously, there were special property courts at certain district courts."
          ],
          "Small claims cases": [
            "Small claims cases are civil cases where the amount claimed does not exceed half a base amount."
          ],
          "Joint petitions": [
            "Joint petitions are petitions for divorce, dissolution of civil partnership and custody of children."
          ],
          "Environmental cases": [
            "These cases are handled by Land and environment courts at the District courts in Nacka, Umeå, Vänersborg, Växjö and Östersund."
